# Keep the build context to what the image needs: no local secrets and
# no host dependencies (built for another OS).
# Patterns match from the context root only: "**/" also covers subfolders.
# Host .env* files (.env.production included) are excluded on purpose, so a
# local build matches the release build made from a clean checkout.
# Tests stay in the context: `tsc -b` compiles them during the build.
node_modules
dist
coverage
**/.env*
.omc
**/.claude
**/.DS_Store
